          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time a model in this unit is destroyed by a melee attack, if that model has not fought this phase, roll one D6: on a 4+, do not remove it from play. The destroyed model can fight after the attacking model’s unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play.</characteristic>
