            <profile name="Amulet of Auto-chastisement" id="01a5-125a-dd54-b50c" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your opponent&apos;s Shooting phase, select one enemy VEHICLE unit (excluding TITANIC units) within 12&quot; of and visible to the bearer. That unit must take a Leadership test. If that test is passed, until the end of the phase, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll. If that test is failed, that unit is not eligible to shoot this phase.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
