                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After both players have deployed their armies, select up to 3 AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM units from your army and redeploy them. When doing so, you can set those units up in Strategic Reserves if you wish, regardless of how many units are already in Strategic Reserves.</characteristic>
