                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time the bearer is selected to shoot, after selecting targets for all of its ranged weapons, select one enemy unit targeted by one or more of the bearer&apos;s attacks and roll three D6: for each 4+, that unit suffers 1 mortal wound. Mortal wounds inflicted by this Crusade Relic can be allocated as if they had the **[PRECISION]** ability.</characteristic>
