              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The bearer&apos;s unit has the Lone Operative, Infiltrators and Stealth abilities. Each time you start a Shadow Operation, you start with 1 Intrigue point.</characteristic>
